# Derived TOST equivalence statistics — tracked as the audit trail for the
# tail-direction correction documented in README ("Analysis corrections").
# These contain aggregate statistics only (mean differences, one-sided
# p-values, confidence intervals), no per-prompt or per-participant data.
# The *_prebugfix files are the superseded outputs, retained for auditability
# and not cited in the manuscript. Raw per-seed CSVs
# (*_corrected_raw.csv) remain ignored.
!experiments/baseline_comparison/dataset_size_equivalence.csv
!experiments/baseline_comparison/population_size_equivalence.csv
!experiments/baseline_comparison/equivalence_tost_table.csv
!experiments/baseline_comparison/dataset_size_equivalence_prebugfix.csv
!experiments/baseline_comparison/population_size_equivalence_prebugfix.csv
